<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Access Denied — Cloutgency CMS</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/images/favicon.png">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/cloutgency.css">

  <style>
    body {
      background: #060505;
      color: #fff;
      font-family: 'Lufga', 'Outfit', sans-serif;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 24px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .denied-box {
      max-width: 480px;
      background: rgba(18, 17, 24, 0.85);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 71, 87, 0.3);
      padding: 40px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 0 30px rgba(255, 71, 87, 0.1);
    }
    .icon {
      font-size: 48px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #ff6b81;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    p {
      font-size: 13.5px;
      color: #aaa;
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #FFD700;
      color: #000;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 13px;
      padding: 10px 24px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }
    .btn:hover {
      background: #FFE566;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.4);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="denied-box">
    <div class="icon">🔒</div>
    <h1>Insufficient Privileges</h1>
    <p>Your current user account does not have permission to access the <strong>[<%= requiredPrivilege %>]</strong> management section. Please contact your Super Admin to update your account privileges.</p>
    <a href="/admin/dashboard" class="btn">Return to Dashboard →</a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
